# Build context for frontend/Dockerfile (issue #640).
#
# Without this file, `COPY . .` dragged the HOST's node_modules (Windows
# .bin shims calling node.exe), dist and tool caches into the image on top
# of the container's own npm ci install — `npm run build` then died with
# "node.exe: not found" (exit 127). Everything here is either re-created
# inside the image (node_modules, dist) or irrelevant to the build.
node_modules
dist
dist-dts
.vite
coverage
.stryker-tmp
.pytest_cache

# Env: never bake local secrets into build contexts.
.env
*.env
